1b:T866,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"CyberGhost在中国能用吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"翻墙出去：不能。因缺乏流量混淆，GFW 能瞬间识别封锁，2021 年后已无法稳定使用（2026-06 广州实测 20 次连接 18 次失败）。翻回国（海外看国内内容）：相对可行，它有中国虚拟节点。国内想翻出去请用机场。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"CyberGhost为什么在中国翻不了墙？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"它的服务器没有「混淆（obfuscation）」，VPN 流量特征明显，GFW 用深度包检测几乎瞬间认出并切断；且用固定公开服务器列表，IP 易被批量封。这和裸用 WireGuard/OpenVPN 翻不了墙是同一道理。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"为什么有的网站说CyberGhost能在中国用？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"警惕 aff 软文。CyberGhost 联盟佣金高，一些站为卖订阅会淡化「中国不可用」。看它有没有明确提「混淆 / stealth」——没有就翻不动，别信「完美支持中国」的宣传。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"CyberGhost是哪个国家的？安全吗？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"2011 年罗马尼亚起家，现属Kape Technologies（与 ExpressVPN、PIA 同母公司）。隐私方面 AES-256 加密、无日志、45 天退款，作为全球 VPN 是安全可靠的——问题只在中国翻墙这个场景。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"CyberGhost vs NordVPN/ExpressVPN 选哪个（中国用）？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"要在中国大陆翻墙，CyberGhost 不行（无混淆）；ExpressVPN 针对受限地区做了混淆优化、相对可用但贵，且近年也在退化。对大陆用户，机场通常比这些国际 VPN 更稳更便宜。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"CyberGhost下载、卸载？","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"官网 cyberghostvpn.com 下载全平台版，别下破解版（木马风险）。卸载残留较常见，用官方卸载工具或手动清理网络适配器配置。"}}]}11:["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-12","children":["$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a",["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1b"}}],["$","blockquote",null,{"className":"my-6 border-l-2 border-accent bg-card py-3 pr-3 pl-4 font-serif text-lg leading-8 text-foreground/85 not-italic","children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"30 秒结论"}]}],["$","$1","1",{"children":"：CyberGhost 是一家"}],["$","$1","2",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"fon